Red Hat Display
---------------
identity/render_logo.py embeds the glyph outlines of the word "Planes", set
in Red Hat Display at weight 700, as SVG path data (`WORDMARK_PATH`). The
outlines were extracted once from the variable font and are used to render the
wordmark in the identity assets under identity/; no font file is redistributed
here.

